Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column${line.separator}company.default.time.zone=America/Los_Angeles|
		|testray.main.component.name|Workflow|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Calendar|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Workflow Configuration|
	And Workflow configure Workflow
		|workflowDefinition|Single Approver (Version 1)|
		|workflowResourceValue|Calendar Event|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarNavigator goto Add Event
	And CalendarEvent add
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Title|
		|eventType|Regular|
		|optionSet|true|
		|optionSetValue|inviteResource|
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
		|specificOptionSetValue|Test Test|
		|workflow|true|
	Then Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Approve Event With Invited User
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When TestCase get Site Name
##########################################################
The Poshi return element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	And CalendarNavigator goto View
		|viewType|Day|
	And CalendarEvent view Site RSVP With Unapproved Workflow
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Title|
		|siteCalendarName|${siteName}|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarNavigator goto View
		|viewType|Week|
	And CalendarEvent view No User Invite With Unapproved Workflow
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Title|
		|siteCalendarName|${siteName}|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow assign To Me Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|Calendar Event Title|
		|workflowAssetType|Calendar Event|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow approve Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|Calendar Event Title|
		|workflowAssetType|Calendar Event|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarNavigator goto View
		|viewType|Week|
	And CalendarEvent view Site RSVP With Approved Workflow
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Title|
		|rsvp|Yes|
		|userCalendarName|Test Test|
	Then CalendarEvent view Invited User RSVP With Approved Workflow
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Title|
		|siteCalendarName|${siteName}|
		|userCalendarName|Test Test|
