Scenario: View Pending Status In Event Details
Priority: 2
	Given CalendarNavigator goto View
		|viewType|Week|
	When CalendarScheduler add Event Today
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Today Week|
		|viewType|Week|
	And CalendarScheduler select Specific Event
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Title|
	And CalendarScheduler goto Details Via Dialog Box
	Then CalendarEvent view Status Via Details
		|status|Pending|